{"coverage":151,"partial":false,"day_closed":true,"window":"00:12–21:15","movers":[{"symbol":"KNACK","ticker":"KNACK","company":"Knack Packaging Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 150.00 cr/year (3-yr contract); ~6.8% of mcap","headline":"**secures a new order and 3-year contract renewal from a major US animal-nutrition and feed corporation**, supplying approximately 60 million packaging bags annually, valued at approximately Rs 150 crore per year","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KNACK_6101_02102026174512_Intimation.pdf","mcap":2473.7,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KNACK_6101_02102026174512_Intimation.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Knack Packaging** - secures a new order and 3-year contract renewal from a major US animal-nutrition and feed corporation for ~60 million PLWPP and Pinch Bottom packaging bags per year, **Rs 150 crore per annum** _(~6.8% of mcap)_.","**Transformers and Rectifiers (India)** - bags two separate orders, from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation (80/125 MVAR shunt reactors, 500 MVA auto transformers) and from Damodar Valley Corporation (500 MVA and 200 MVA auto transformers); both fall in TARIL's own 'Large Orders' bucket (Rs 100-500 cr each), exact value undisclosed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**TD Power Systems** - receives listing approval for 12,50,000 equity shares allotted to Promoters on preferential basis at Rs 600 per share, **Rs 75.00 crore**."],"equity_allotments":["**United Heat Transfer** - receives NSE in-principle approval for a proposed preferential issue of 29,68,000 equity shares at Rs 105.50, **Rs 31.31 crore**, _(enabling approval - allotment still pending)_."],"m_and_a":["**Aurobindo Pharma** - completes, through subsidiary Apitoria, the acquisition of the Contract Research Services business of A1 Biochem Group, including A1 Biochem Labs (India) and its US step-down A1 Biochem Labs LLC (sales USD 5.92 million in CY2025), creating an integrated CRDMO platform.","**Hindustan Aeronautics** - signs an agreement to acquire CAE Canada's remaining 50% stake in HATSOFF Helicopter Training (turnover Rs 80.95 cr in FY26) at NIL consideration, converting the joint venture into a wholly-owned subsidiary.","**Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders** - clarifies it has not proceeded with the Thoothukudi, Tamil Nadu shipyard cluster after a rival was selected as anchor shipyard; remains focused on Dighi (Maharashtra) and Dugarajapatnam (Andhra Pradesh) clusters."],"capex_core":["**Shyam Metalics and Energy** - signs a NON-BINDING MoU with the Government of Maharashtra for a proposed 9 MTPA Greenfield Integrated Steel Complex at Chandrapur, estimated investment **Rs 50,000 crore**, initiation targeted FY2026-27 subject to approvals _(non-binding intent, not an executed commitment)_.","**ADF Foods** - signs an EPC contract with CleanMax Enviro Energy Solutions to install a 950 KWp rooftop solar power plant at its Surat facility, meeting ~46% of the facility's energy needs (value not disclosed)."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 2 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Sobha** - posts its highest-ever half-yearly sales value of Rs 5,862 crore in H1 FY27 (+47.2% YoY), led by Bangalore (57.7% of sales); launched 7.91 million sft across 5 projects.","**V2 Retail** - Q2 FY27 standalone revenue grows 28.4% YoY to Rs 905 crore on continued store-network expansion (49 new stores in the quarter, 427 total).","**Sambhv Steel Tubes** - reports its highest-ever Q2 FY27 sales volume for value-added products (1,13,591 tonnes), led by structural pipes/tubes and GP coils.","**Adani Ports and SEZ** - handles 46 MMT of cargo in September 2026 (+11% YoY), led by containers (+15% YoY)."],"distress_risk":["**Awfis Space Solutions** - receives an adverse arbitration award over a terminated lease dispute with Ruby Infotech, **Rs 8.26 crore** plus interest and costs; net incremental cost impact not expected to exceed Rs 6.3 crore after fit-out write-offs.","**Ideaforge Technology** - receives a GST demand order under Section 74 for tax of INR 54.59 crore plus an equal penalty (**~Rs 109.17 crore** total) for FY22-24; company plans to appeal, citing a 2025 government clarification that drones attract 5% GST.","**Aether Industries** - the GST department drops its Rs 4.26 crore demand and show-cause notice tied to IPO-period tax credits, with no financial impact.","**TV Vision** - post-facto intimation of its 2nd Committee of Creditors meeting under CIRP; CIRP costs of Rs 7.00 lakh approved."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Acme Solar Holdings** - CRISIL revises its outlook to 'Positive' from 'Stable' (rating reaffirmed at CRISIL AA-) on bank facilities enhanced to **Rs 2,500 crore** from Rs 1,500 crore."],"other_notable":["**Agastya Energy and Infrastructure** - corrigendum details allocation of its pending preferential-issue proceeds (Rs 566.10 cr) toward subsidiaries' solar manufacturing capex _(enabling resolution ahead of the October 7 EGM - not an executed deal)_."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KNACK_6101_02102026174512_Intimation.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRIL_02102026163021_IntimationofOrder02102026GETCO.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/co